OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a chilly, locally misty
OL,6,Fstart Thursday morning looks fine with
OL,7,Flight winds and plenty of warm hazy
OL,8,Fsunshine. However, cloud will slowly
OL,9,Fbegin to increase from the west during
OL,10,Fthe afternoon as a southerly breeze
OL,11,Fdevelops.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThere will be some clear
OL,14,Fspells in the east during the evening.
OL,15,FHowever, cloud will continue to
OL,16,Fthicken from the west overnight with
OL,17,Fsome light rain arriving later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
