OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FThe odd bright interval in the
OL,6,Feast initially, but Friday generally
OL,7,Flooks rather cloudy with mist and fog
OL,8,Fpatches gradually lifting. Occasional
OL,9,Flight rain also affecting northern and
OL,10,Fwestern areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FSaturday looks fine with any early fog
OL,14,Flifting to leave some sunshine. A
OL,15,Fchance of some showery rain on Sunday,
OL,16,Fthen becoming mostly dry, albeit
OL,17,Fbreezy on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
